[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3905915034","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/116335#issuecomment-3905915034","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/116335","id":3905915034,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7oz4ia","user":{"login":"Yobbolita","id":198503602,"node_id":"U_kgDOC9Tssg","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/198503602?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Yobbolita","html_url":"https://github.com/Yobbolita","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Yobbolita/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Yobbolita/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Yobbolita/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Yobbolita/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Yobbolita/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Yobbolita/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Yobbolita/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Yobbolita/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Yobbolita/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-02-16T01:09:52Z","updated_at":"2026-02-16T01:09:52Z","body":"Did you try what [syntaxerror247](https://github.com/syntaxerror247) suggested in https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/115983 ?\n\n> [@Yobbolita](https://github.com/Yobbolita) This is an expected behaviour. Native file dialog on Android can only access the filesystem, it is documented here https://docs.godotengine.org/en/latest/classes/class_filedialog.html#class-filedialog-property-use-native-dialog\n> \n> > Note: On Android, it is only supported when using [ACCESS_FILESYSTEM](https://docs.godotengine.org/en/latest/classes/class_filedialog.html#class-filedialog-constant-access-filesystem). For access mode [ACCESS_RESOURCES](https://docs.godotengine.org/en/latest/classes/class_filedialog.html#class-filedialog-constant-access-resources) and [ACCESS_USERDATA](https://docs.godotengine.org/en/latest/classes/class_filedialog.html#class-filedialog-constant-access-userdata), the system will fall back to custom FileDialog.\n> \n> In method 1, You haven't set the access mode to `ACCESS_FILESYSTEM`, so it's falling back to Godot's custom FileDialog. Same in method 2, but here nothing happens because you haven't added the node to scene tree.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3905915034/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3906851022","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/116335#issuecomment-3906851022","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/116335","id":3906851022,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7o3dDO","user":{"login":"0ttoman","id":24543934,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI0NTQzOTM0","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/24543934?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/0ttoman","html_url":"https://github.com/0ttoman","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/0ttoman/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/0ttoman/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/0ttoman/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/0ttoman/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/0ttoman/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/0ttoman/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/0ttoman/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/0ttoman/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/0ttoman/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"c